731001-55d89f80-7dbf-4fe9-9545-e7241a0ff6db"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Kickoff/resume: single code leaf irongray-unlucky-discus, six recorded file-impact paths, worktree /Users/joeoakhart/prepare-comment-echo-reclaim-93c4 on branch prepare-comment-echo-reclaim-93c4 at current origin/main e330e286b007. Landing method is one Gerrit change with LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1 before submit/close. Inherited manifest builder and tests had no recorded RED run, so they receive no RED-first credit and are being treated as an untrusted draft; new or strengthened contract behavior will be proven RED-first. Manifest test card: authority=ticket semantic oracle and exact incident tuple; preconditions=clean standalone unfiltered non-promisor Git repo, exact tip, verified off-repo bundle/manifest, complete Jira pagination, stable remote refs; production path=incident builder and real Git plumbing with only Jira represented by captured production-shaped JSON; tier=integration with real temporary source/bare remote because refs/blobs/bundles are contractual; exact postcondition=canonical deterministic immutable manifest selecting one live Jira identity and enumerating exact removals/transforms; collateral invariants=source worktree/ref and authoritative remote unchanged, bridge mapping protected, non-target material unchanged; contrast=ambiguous/incomplete/moving/shared/dirty/promisor inputs refuse without output; gate=focused pytest plus make test. Surface census: script CLI is in scope and needs subprocess coverage; MCP/API, public library, automated reconcilers/bots, and dual-direction mirror are out of scope because this is incident-specific offline preparation tooling with no production registration, caller, write surface, or inverse operation.","timestamp":1787551103774712001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Manifest milestone: inherited focused suite first ran 4 pass/1 fixture-construction failure; corrected nested tmp parent only, then 5/5 passed. Added RED-first ambiguity oracles: duplicate snapshot source UUID, duplicate authorship-ledger event UUID, and duplicate backup remote-census row all initially failed to raise; implementation now rejects them and focused manifest suite is 8/8 green with file-level Ruff. Rewrite contract: happy plus held-out graph/replay/recovery/no-push/drift/rollback tests all observed RED against the explicit not-implemented scaffold; implementation worker sees only the happy test. Drafted the incident runbook and indexed it; docs index checker passes. Corrected the ticket DD-DOCS command from nonexistent make check-docs to the live python scripts/check_docs_index.py --check; review-plan status remains certified/current on file-impact basis.","timestamp":1787552875032731001}],"created_at":1787551061202538001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"f478ded5-36a4-4404-8c4d-c00983112376","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"93c4-2b9f-749a-4243"}],"description":"","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","93c4-2b9f-749a-4243"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"a549-175a-53fc-40b8","ticket_type":"session_log","title":"Prepare manifest-driven comment-echo reclaim","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["167d62f6-8a3b-4c7d-a85d-f206f4b92099","f47